1
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:15,999
Glory to Kreupasanam Mother and the Holy Trinity. My name is Jeece Varghese. This is my

2
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:24,999
wife Bincy and our daughter Kesia. The first time we took the covenant was on June 14th, 2023. For the past few

3
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:31,999
years, we have been living permanently in the United States due to work. Our home

4
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:35,999
is inherited, and we come from a place called Mamalassery.

5
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:43,999
Through the intercession of the Holy Mother, we have received countless blessings in our life from Jesus.

6
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:49,999
We are standing here to bear witness to these blessings. This is our first time visiting here; we came in June

7
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:54,999
for vacation, and just a few days before my wife was to leave, the Mother

8
00:00:55,000 --> 00:01:00,999
revealed to me, as she had told me, that we should come here, pray, and

9
00:01:01,000 --> 00:01:02,999
dedicate the concerns of our life.

10
00:01:03,000 --> 00:01:11,999
At that moment, as Sister Jomol often says in her meditations, it felt as though everything in life was lost, with no merits left,

11
00:01:12,000 --> 00:01:16,999
standing completely empty-handed, yet holding on firmly, like a grip in a situation where everything else is gone.

12
00:01:17,000 --> 00:01:20,999
Coming and settling in this holy land is something I consider a blessing.

13
00:01:21,000 --> 00:01:28,999
For the first time, it is about my daughter. My daughter is a special kid. Despite many weaknesses and difficulties,

14
00:01:29,000 --> 00:01:37,999
the Mother has been our support and has helped make many improvements in her. Even now, her situation remains under the Mother’s consideration.

15
00:01:38,000 --> 00:01:44,999
I thank the Mother and Jesus for all the improvements given so far.

16
00:01:45,000 --> 00:01:54,999
Secondly, I want to share something about a piece of land transaction. For many years, we were

17
00:01:55,000 --> 00:02:00,999
unable to sell a piece of land because of issues I hadn’t even included in my covenant intentions.

18
00:02:01,000 --> 00:02:04,999
Beyond that, we had more than sixty such issues for all of us.

19
00:02:05,000 --> 00:02:11,999
So I took the covenant, and a few months later, someone we never expected

20
00:02:12,000 --> 00:02:16,999
called my father expressing interest in acquiring our land, right next to our property.

21
00:02:17,000 --> 00:02:19,999
That person said they were interested in obtaining this land.

22
00:02:20,000 --> 00:02:27,999
We did not approach any other buyer. Without telling anyone, without any doubts or difficulties,

23
00:02:28,000 --> 00:02:34,999
the transaction was carried out by the Mother in the smoothest possible way, at the price we mentioned.

24
00:02:35,000 --> 00:02:39,999
For that, I give glory to the Mother Mary and Jesus.

25
00:02:40,000 --> 00:02:46,999
Thirdly, I am an official in the central government in the U.S. While I was working there,

26
00:02:47,000 --> 00:02:55,999
I have been employed in the central government since 2018. My work carries tremendous pressure, even though I am qualified and hold a master’s degree.

27
00:02:56,000 --> 00:02:59,999
I have more than a 10 years of experience. None of that mattered there.

28
00:03:00,000 --> 00:03:02,999
At that time, as our Father always say, it is not by merit,

29
00:03:03,000 --> 00:03:10,999
but by grace. It was only by that grace, by that blessing, that I received a transfer in that job.

30
00:03:11,000 --> 00:03:17,999
I never expected it. I took the covenant, went to the U.S. in September, and a manager I had worked with before

31
00:03:18,000 --> 00:03:23,999
called me there. That person is now a manager in a high position.

32
00:03:24,000 --> 00:03:32,999
He told me that there was a position in his department, and if I was interested, I could apply. At that time,

33
00:03:33,000 --> 00:03:43,999
I had already applied for many positions over the years, attended interviews, and sent my resume to many,

34
00:03:44,000 --> 00:03:52,999
but no one even looked back. All my experience and merit were useless. In that completely empty-handed situation,

35
00:03:53,000 --> 00:04:03,999
I tell everyone: pray, take the covenant, and your matters will proceed. This is a perfect example.

36
00:04:04,000 --> 00:04:08,999
A panel of five people under him interviewed me. I don’t know exactly what was said there,

37
00:04:09,000 --> 00:04:16,999
but simply, I got the job. I am still continuing in that job, and I am very happy there.

38
00:04:17,000 --> 00:04:25,999
It is a job with many challenges, yet I am satisfied. For that, I give thanks to the Mother and Jesus.

39
00:04:26,000 --> 00:04:36,999
Fourthly, in October 2023, my wife had irregular periods. When she underwent scanning,

40
00:04:37,000 --> 00:04:44,999
they found a hernia-type finding in the bile duct, and a cyst in the ovary. At that time, all of this

41
00:04:45,000 --> 00:04:58,999
worried us. As the Father always says, Covenant medal is a weapon; with it in hand, you can proceed.

42
00:04:59,000 --> 00:05:07,999
With that courage, we went for an ultrasound. The doctor said there was no problem, and there was nothing to worry about.

43
00:05:08,000 --> 00:05:13,999
For that blessing from the Mother, we give abundant thanks.

44
00:05:14,000 --> 00:05:20,999
has given us many blessings; there isn’t enough time to describe them all here.

45
00:05:21,000 --> 00:05:27,999
Likewise, one day, after finishing work, my wife and I were returning together, reciting the rosary.

46
00:05:28,000 --> 00:05:35,999
I moved a vehicle aside to go home quickly. A large vehicle came at a terrifying speed toward us.

47
00:05:36,000 --> 00:05:40,999
By a major accident, at that time, the Mother saved us.

48
00:05:41,000 --> 00:05:48,999
That day, I said it was because I had this “weapon” in my hand—the rosary—that we were saved.

49
00:05:49,000 --> 00:05:54,999
That is how we were saved there. Likewise, we continue to face many, many challenges in the family even now.

50
00:05:55,000 --> 00:05:59,999
During the COVID period, we were wishing for a new vehicle.

51
00:06:00,000 --> 00:06:05,999
Because of COVID, vehicles were not available anywhere. We wanted a van in a specific way.

52
00:06:06,000 --> 00:06:14,999
After taking the covenant in June, by November, the vehicle that had been reserved for a friend of mine

53
00:06:15,000 --> 00:06:19,999
went to someone else because that friend got another vehicle. The dealership person called him and said,

54
00:06:20,000 --> 00:06:24,999
“If the vehicle reserved for you can be given to someone else, you can get a good offer.”

55
00:06:25,000 --> 00:06:28,999
That friend felt like calling me, so I went.

56
00:06:29,000 --> 00:06:33,999
The vehicle was exactly what we had wished for. In November itself, we got it without any difficulty.

57
00:06:34,000 --> 00:06:43,999
Now, last but not least, my blood work from last March: for two years I hadn’t done any tests because I was afraid.

58
00:06:44,000 --> 00:06:51,999
Our lifestyle is extremely hectic. Medically speaking, it is a very hectic lifestyle.

59
00:06:52,000 --> 00:06:56,999
We couldn’t properly monitor our health. I hadn’t seen a doctor for two years because of fear.

60
00:06:57,000 --> 00:07:00,999
During COVID, I worked from home, didn’t pay attention to food, and developed a fatty liver problem.

61
00:07:01,000 --> 00:07:06,999
It was called an “upgrade one” condition. I was afraid, so I didn’t get it done.

62
00:07:07,000 --> 00:07:12,999
Finally, last March, I did my blood work. The doctor said my lipid panel is at a controllable stage.

63
00:07:13,000 --> 00:07:15,999
He also said my liver function is normal and there was nothing to

64
00:07:16,000 --> 00:07:19,999
worry about. For this, I give glory to Jesus and the Holy Mother.

65
00:07:20,000 --> 00:07:25,999
Last but not least, the Mother Mary and Jesus continue to shower many blessings in our life.

66
00:07:26,000 --> 00:07:34,999
Let me share one more blessing: after taking the covenant, we went to the U.S., and in three months—90 days—we completed all matters properly.

67
00:07:35,000 --> 00:07:39,999
Like a “test dose,” I have a habit of playing cricket there. When I wanted to play cricket,

68
00:07:40,000 --> 00:07:47,999
there was a Malayali cricket tournament at a club level. The selection process was ongoing.

69
00:07:48,000 --> 00:07:53,999
I am not a top player, nor do I have any credentials, but I knew that during the finals that year,

70
00:07:54,000 --> 00:07:58,999
when my team played, I would get a chance to be in the playing eleven.

71
00:07:59,000 --> 00:08:04,999
Even though I knew this, I considered it like a “test dose” from the Mother.

72
00:08:05,000 --> 00:08:08,999
I called my captain and said I was interested in playing. A younger player than me was there,

73
00:08:09,000 --> 00:08:15,999
and I told him, “Hey, if I play, will it be okay? I have no credentials, but I want to play.”

74
00:08:16,000 --> 00:08:20,999
I said, “If you just give me a chance, I will try my utmost and do my best.”

75
00:08:21,000 --> 00:08:26,999
I have no credentials. There are many players far more skilled and experienced than me. Even then, he gave me his word:

76
00:08:27,000 --> 00:08:33,999
“Brother, you will be in this year’s playing eleven.” I knew I had to accept it, and so I played.

77
00:08:34,000 --> 00:08:41,999
By playing, we ended up becoming champions that year. We won the cup. From that

78
00:08:42,000 --> 00:08:52,999
moment, I believed that the Mother had blessed the agreement I made, and Jesus intervened.

79
00:08:53,000 --> 00:09:01,999
Next, as part of the covenant, we were to perform acts of mercy. We try, as much as possible, to help many people every week.

80
00:09:02,000 --> 00:09:11,999
I had a special experience: within a few months of taking the covenant, I received a call from a father I knew in my hometown.

81
00:09:12,000 --> 00:09:15,999
He said there was a family near his office who were in great distress.

82
00:09:16,000 --> 00:09:18,999
That family was in debt, and he asked,

83
00:09:19,000 --> 00:09:23,999
“If it is possible, you should do it,” he said. I immediately responded, “Yes, I will definitely do

84
00:09:24,000 --> 00:09:27,999
it.” That same day, I was able to provide the amount needed to release them from the debt.

85
00:09:28,000 --> 00:09:30,999
Being able to help like that amazed me. Later, I called that brother to check on him.

86
00:09:31,000 --> 00:09:33,999
When I called, he said, “Brother, I am so happy that you did this.”

87
00:09:34,000 --> 00:09:43,999
I replied, “I did not do it; it was the Kreupasanam Mother who did it.”

88
00:09:44,000 --> 00:09:50,999
That brother then told me that he took the covenant for this matter.

89
00:09:51,000 --> 00:09:54,999
At that moment, I realized that a mother who has taken the covenant

90
00:09:55,000 --> 00:09:59,999
can connect and link things anywhere in the world, even without us knowing. This is a perfect example of that.

91
00:10:00,000 --> 00:10:08,999
Somewhere in a corner of Kerala, through me, who was in America, the Mother intervened through the covenant.

92
00:10:09,000 --> 00:10:12,999
Thus, those charitable works continued.

93
00:10:13,000 --> 00:10:21,999
Now, in America, every three or four months, I donate blood.

94
00:10:22,000 --> 00:10:28,999
This is part of devotional service. Everything I do, I prepare three weeks in advance.

95
00:10:29,000 --> 00:10:34,999
When the needle pricks me, there is pain, but it is done purely for God’s love.

96
00:10:35,000 --> 00:10:44,999
Then, there is a government-run facility where sick children can receive free treatment.

97
00:10:45,000 --> 00:10:55,999
Parents come from far away, from various countries, and stay there for months so their children can receive care.

98
00:10:56,000 --> 00:10:59,999
They are being treated at nearby hospitals, so they have the opportunity to stay there for free and also get meals.

99
00:11:00,000 --> 00:11:05,999
They stay at a three-star level hotel and have every facility to manage their stay.

100
00:11:06,000 --> 00:11:11,999
While staying there for two weeks, they spend four hours doing voluntary service in the hospital kitchen.

101
00:11:12,000 --> 00:11:19,999
None of this is due to our merit; this is something special that we are doing.

102
00:11:20,000 --> 00:11:23,999
Faith without the works of James 2:17 is dead.

103
00:11:24,000 --> 00:11:36,999
Prayer, proclamation, and action—all three together constitute the covenant, and by believing this, we carry everything forward with Mother’s and Jesus’s grace.

104
00:11:37,000 --> 00:11:41,999
Once again, coming to this holy land, glorifying God from this altar, and

105
00:11:42,000 --> 00:11:49,999
testifying, I thank Mother and Jesus a thousand times for all the blessings.

106
00:11:50,000 --> 00:11:52,999
Glory be to Jesus. Hail Mary.

107
00:11:53,000 --> 00:12:01,999
2 Corinthians 6:2

108
00:12:02,000 --> 00:12:07,999
“At an acceptable time, I listened to your prayer and helped you on the day of salvation.”

109
00:12:08,000 --> 00:12:20,999
Now, at this acceptable time, at the day of salvation, Jeece comes and testifies.

110
00:12:21,000 --> 00:12:28,999
With great joy, came to the counter to confirm the testimony.

111
00:12:29,000 --> 00:12:36,999
Because through all his difficulties, by invoking the intercession of the Blessed Mother, he was able to endure all this for Jesus.

112
00:12:37,000 --> 00:12:42,999
He speaks with the firm assurance that all of this was done by Jesus for him.

113
00:12:43,000 --> 00:12:50,999
He gives this testimony with a very challenging heart, making him a witness to the apparition.

114
00:12:51,000 --> 00:12:56,999
Whenever each child proclaims, the Blessed Mother accepts it in different ways, as we observe here.

115
00:12:57,000 --> 00:13:02,999
Every painful situation, even the pinpricks of suffering, I dedicate to Jesus.

116
00:13:03,000 --> 00:13:09,999
This family has grown today to bear many children’s sufferings.

117
00:13:10,000 --> 00:13:16,999
Seeing this, they are all in sorrow but have a great heart to help.

118
00:13:17,000 --> 00:13:22,999
By grace, they have received this ability, as we understand through this testimony.

119
00:13:23,000 --> 00:13:32,999
Even at such a high level, Jesus has given this family the grace to be humble.

120
00:13:33,000 --> 00:13:40,999
In a special situation of Kesia daughter, the family and Jesus are enduring great pain.

121
00:13:41,000 --> 00:13:47,999
Although there are minor differences, now through this covenant, it is becoming part of their life, he proclaims.

122
00:13:48,000 --> 00:13:54,999
They continue to hope and pray for a perfect healing for this daughter.

123
00:13:55,000 --> 00:13:58,999
Let us pray for all the special children around the world.

124
00:13:59,000 --> 00:14:05,999
Let us pray, joining all our intentions with this testimony, for Jesus and the family.

125
00:14:06,000 --> 00:14:11,999
Again, praying specifically for Kesia daughter and other such children, dedicating our prayers through this testimony.

126
00:14:12,000 --> 00:14:18,999
We offer this testimony as a good deed to Jesus and the Blessed Mother.

127
00:14:19,000 --> 00:14:26,999
Such extraordinary divine experiences can now be yours as well. If you haven’t subscribed to this YouTube channel yet, do it now.

128
00:14:27,000 --> 00:14:31,000
